    "Clip 运行期间，在其他应用复制也会响；暂停记录不影响声音。一次复制只响一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clip 运行期间，在其他应用复制也会响；暂停记录不影响声音。一次复制只响一次。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While Clip is running, copying in other apps plays the sound too; pausing history does not mute it. Each copy plays once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
