    "从下载版迁移：先在旧版导出配置，再在这里导入。剪贴板历史独立保存在商店版容器中，不随配置迁移。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从下载版迁移：先在旧版导出配置，再在这里导入。剪贴板历史独立保存在商店版容器中，不随配置迁移。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moving from the downloaded version: export settings there first, then import them here. Clipboard history is stored separately in the App Store version's container and does not move with settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
