    "首次开启整理最近 500 条，随后记录的新内容自动加入。文本、链接、图片可在 iOS Clip 取用；文件路径不上传，富文本按纯文本归档。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次开启整理最近 500 条，随后记录的新内容自动加入。文本、链接、图片可在 iOS Clip 取用；文件路径不上传，富文本按纯文本归档。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turning it on the first time archives the latest 500 clips; new clips are added automatically after that. Text, links and images are available in Clip on iOS; file paths are not uploaded and rich text is archived as plain text."
          }
        }
      }
    }
